# Cursor — project rules

## Canonical workflow

Follow **`docs/AI_WORKFLOW.md`**. Non-trivial work starts with `/ask-matt`. Do not contradict the workflow; one-line exceptions with rationale only. Glossary: **`CONTEXT.md`**.

## Stack & layout

- **Stack**: Node.js (ES modules), Express in **`server/`**, React 18 + Vite in **`client/`**.
- **Client UI**: Chat studio in **`client/src/studio/`**. Read **`design-system/MCP-UI/MASTER.md`** before JSX. Host chrome is shadcn; generated HTML uses ThemeAdapter in **`packages/core/src/design-systems/`**.
- **Monorepo**: Root **`package.json`**; **`client/package.json`**. `npm install` at root; `npm run install-all`; `npm run skills:install` after clone.

## Mandatory checks

- After changing **`client/`** JS/JSX: run **`npm run lint`** from **`client/`**.
- After **`packages/core`**: run **`npm test`**.
- Validate changed flows (see **`README.md`**).

## Architecture

- Keep API and MCP server logic in **`server/`**; UI only in **`client/src/`**.
- Jev fan-out decides; `applyPolicy` hydrates; Claude only on low confidence / `needs_llm`. Never send full payloads to an LLM.
- Avoid circular **`server/`** imports.

## Security

- Secrets only via environment variables. Local: **`.env.local`**. Never commit secrets or put them in prompts, logs, or agent output.

## Exploration policy

Structured navigation first: **`README.md`**, **`CONTEXT.md`**, **`docs/AI_WORKFLOW.md`**, **`CLAUDE.md`**, then scoped search in **`server/`** or **`client/`**. MCP: **cursor-ide-browser**; **user-ai-agent-committee** if configured — read tool schemas before calling.

## Claude Code parity

Project instructions live in **`CLAUDE.md`**; skills under **`.claude/skills/`**. Matt `tdd`/`code-review` replace duplicate playbooks.
